{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >After being turned\u00a0 into a cat against his will (again), Woney wakes in a familiar place,\u00a0 with little memory of his current situation.\u00a0 All he knows is there's only one way out; Death. Whether it be his, or anyone who stands in his way.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A turn based RPG/roguelike hybrid with an emphasis on story.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 Spells to Pick and Choose from Each Run!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever changing and winding halls of a Witch's Manor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a quirky, yet haunting story about a Witch's Familiar trying to set himself free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize until you're a force to be reckoned with\u00a0in\u00a0this\u00a0Turn\u00a0based\u00a0Rogue\u00a0Like!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817980?t=1756058327","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817980?t=1756058327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817980/54c0933dac6d935a0b229bda0ee2519cd466af9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756058327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817980/54c0933dac6d935a0b229bda0ee2519cd466af9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756058327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch O